{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026HOEXdkFfWq1794321888.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>美國人工智能(AI)公司Anthropic，據報通過首次公開招股和配售，籌集最多904億美元。</p><p></p><p>《彭博》引述Anthropic提交美國證券交易委員會的文件，透過首次公開招股集資最多644億美元，招股價介乎70至80美元。私募配售則集資260億美元。對象包括AMD、博通、美光科技、微軟、輝達和台積電等。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-10T15:43:02.155762+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":151,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-10T14:43:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-11T00:22:42.828403+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-10T15:36:16.539557+00:00","content_hash":"5919c88b1b367a33505675124637f36cead08c05039f69c8edecc7d0e5d3154f","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}